    {
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## listing-heroes: ComfyUI job\nCalled by the GPU pipeline. Items are jobs: {server, workflow, params, dir, name, repo, mode}.\n\n- **mode submit**: uploads the input photos, fills the workflow from pipeline/comfyui/workflows, queues it, returns prompt_id.\n- **mode collect**: polls /history every 10 s, downloads every output to dir/name[-label].ext.\n\nPure HTTP to ComfyUI: nothing to install.",
        "height": 420,
        "width": 520
      },
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -520,
        -260
      ],
      "id": "224c2ec5-e1e9-59ae-8072-e0c0f8e3802b"
    }
